001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     TQUOTINQ.
001300 AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER.
001400 INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.   MARCH 1987.
001600 DATE-COMPILED.
001800*REMARKS.
001900*D   MAIN PROGRAM FOR QUOTE INQUIRY
002000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002100 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002200 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002300 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
002700 DATA DIVISION.
002800 FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.
003700
002900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1   PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2   PIC X.
024200 01  STATUS-AREA.
024300     05  COND-WORD            PIC S9(4)    VALUE ZERO COMP-4.
024400         88  GOOD-CALL                            VALUE 0.
024500         88  END-OF-FILE                          VALUE 11.
024600         88  START-OF-CHAIN                       VALUE 14.
024700         88  END-OF-CHAIN                         VALUE 15.
024800         88  NO-ENTRY                             VALUE 17.
024900     05  DATA-LENGTH          PIC S9(4)  COMP-4.
025000     05  RCD-NO               PIC S9(9)  COMP-4.
025100     05  CHAIN-LENGTH         PIC S9(9)  COMP-4.
025200     05  BKWD-ADDR            PIC S9(9)  COMP-4.
025300     05  FWRD-ADDR            PIC S9(9)  COMP-4.
025400
       COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYCSIS.
003320 01  PASS-SPOOL          PIC S9(2) VALUE ZEROES COMP-4.
028300 01  FORMFILE                 PIC X(26).
003400 COPY MPLTINFO OF COPYCSIS.
       01  PLT-ARG             PIC X(4).
       01  PLANT-CODE          PIC X(4).
003401 COPY TSPLPRT OF COPYCSIS.
005000 01  BASE                PIC X(10) VALUE "  STORES;".
012000 COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYCSIS.
013100 COPY LANGUAGE OF COPYCSIS.
       COPY ESCNAME  OF COPYCSIS.
014100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
014200 00-MAIN.
018910     CALL "TSPLPRT" USING SP-RET-CODE, SP-AREA.
018915     IF SP-RET-CODE NOT = "00"
018916         MOVE "00" TO PASS-SPOOL
            ELSE
018919         MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO (1)          TO  PASS-SPOOL.
014400
030100*----------  FIND THE PLANT NUMBER AND PASS IT TO SUBROUTINES
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO.
030200     MOVE "P 01" TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
033300     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
033400           MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO - TQUOTINQ " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
033500           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
030800     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY TO PLANT-CODE.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO.
014500     CALL "SQUOTINQ" USING BASE, PASS-SPOOL, VIEW-COMAREA,
                           FORMFILE, PLANT-CODE, ESC-NAME,
                           LANGUAGE-PARMS.
014800
014900     GOBACK.
128400 990-BLOWUP.
129100     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
129200                   VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG     ,
129300                   BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
129400 999-EXIT.     EXIT.
